sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor PA as Platform Admin
    participant UI as Platform page
    participant Dialog as ConfirmActionDialog
    participant API as Platform API
    participant Auth as Platform authorization
    participant Service as Lifecycle or admin service
    participant Audit as Platform audit service
    participant DB as Platform database

    PA->>UI: Choose risky action
    UI->>Dialog: Open target, scope, impact, current to next state
    Dialog-->>PA: Show confirmation and required reason

    alt Cancel
        PA->>Dialog: Cancel
        Dialog-->>UI: Restore focus to trigger; no mutation
    else Blank or invalid reason
        PA->>Dialog: Confirm without valid reason
        Dialog-->>PA: Inline validation and focus on reason
    else Confirm with nonblank reason
        PA->>Dialog: Confirm
        Dialog->>UI: Lock duplicate submit and show pending state
        UI->>API: Send action, target, reason, idempotency context
        API->>Auth: Verify PLATFORM_ADMIN capability

        alt Unauthorized or unavailable
            Auth-->>API: 403 or non-disclosing 404
            API-->>UI: Generic unavailable result
            UI->>Dialog: Keep safe context or route to safe parent
            Dialog-->>PA: No target data disclosure
        else Authorized
            Auth-->>API: Permit Platform control-plane action
            API->>Service: Apply requested transition or command
            Service->>DB: Validate current state and write mutation

            alt Validation or state conflict
                DB-->>Service: Validation error or conflict
                Service-->>API: Failure; prior state unchanged
                API-->>UI: Field or conflict result
                UI->>Dialog: Keep reason and offer refresh or retry
            else Mutation valid
                Service->>Audit: Append actor, target, action, reason, outcome
                Audit->>DB: Write immutable audit event in same transaction

                alt Audit write fails
                    DB-->>Audit: Audit write failure
                    Audit-->>Service: Fail transaction
                    Service-->>API: Mutation not completed
                    API-->>UI: Failure; never claim success
                    UI->>Dialog: Preserve prior state and offer retry
                else Audit written
                    DB-->>Audit: Audit identifier and timestamp
                    Audit-->>Service: Durable outcome reference
                    Service-->>API: Updated resource plus audit outcome
                    API-->>UI: Confirmed result
                    UI->>UI: Refresh detail or list from server state
                    UI-->>PA: Inline durable outcome; toast is supplementary only
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over PA,DB: Applies to tenant lifecycle, approved billing-exception triage, and Platform Admin status actions.
    Note over API,Auth: PLATFORM_ADMIN may not use this flow for tenant parking operations or impersonation.
